    "en": "In the past 8 hours the DSH ecosystem added 36 plugins, with 291 new stars on the official repo and 382,930 weekly npm downloads, alongside the dsh 0.1.7-rc.2 release; however 12,825 of 16,126 non-fork plugins have been inactive for 7 days, giving a health score of 37 and concentrating growth in a few desktop projects.",
